  "question": {
    "text": "The non stoichiometric compound $\\mathrm{Fe}_{0.94} \\mathrm{O}$ is formed when $\\mathrm{x} \\%$ of $\\mathrm{Fe}^{2+}$ ions are replaced by as many $\\frac{2}{3} \\mathrm{Fe}^{3+}$ ions, $\\mathrm{x}$ is",
